  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\n \n \n\n **Sign**\n *\n @\n #\n \n \n\n **Means**\n ×\n ×\n +\n \n \n\nLet's check,\n\n**7 * 5 @ 10 # 20 = 370**\n\n→ **7 ×**** 5** × 10 + 20 = 370\n\n→ **35 ****×**** 10** + 20 = 370\n\n→ 350 + 20 = 370\n\n**4 * 3 @ 5 # 30 = 90**\n\n→ **4 × 3** × 5 + 30 = 90\n\n→ **12 ****×**** 5** + 30 = 90\n\n→ 60 + 30 = 90\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**2 * 3 @ 4 # 5 = ?**\n\n→ **2 × 3** × 4 + 5 = ?\n\n→ **6 ****×**** 4** + 5 = ?\n\n→ 24 + 5 = 29\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"29\"**.",
